			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "NOTES: UNLESS OTHERWISE SPECIFIED\n\n1. STANDARDS:\n   A. FABRICATE PCB IN ACCORDANCE WITH IPC-6012 CLASS2\n   B. ACCEPTABILITY PER IPC-A-600 CLASS 2\n   C. SOLDER MASK PER IPC-SM-840 CLASS T\n2. MATERIAL:\n   A. BASE MATERIAL: FR-4, Tg ≥150°C, UL94-V0\n   B. FINAL BOARD THICKNESS: 1.6 mm\n   C. COPPER WEIGHT: 1 oz (35 µm)\n   D. LAYER STACK-UP SHALL BE AS PER APPROVED FABRICATION DRAWING\n3. SURFACE FINISH:\n   A. ALL AREAS EXPOSED AFTER SOLDERMASK TO BE LEADFREE-HASL\n   B. COATING THICKNESS AS PER IPC-6012 CLASS2 REQUIREMENTS\n4. SOLDERMASK:\n   A. LIQUID PHOTOIMAGEABLE (LPI) SOLDER MASK, COLOR: GREEN\n   B. SOLDER MASK REQUIRED ON BOTH SIDES OF PCB\n   C. TO BE IN ACCORDANCE WITH IPC-SM-840 CLASS T\n5. SILKSCREEN (LEGEND):\n   A. NON-CONDUCTIVE EPOXY INK, COLOR: WHITE\n   B. REQUIRED ON BOTH SIDES OF PCB AS NOTED IN GERBER FILES\n   C. SHALL NOT OVERLAP PADS OR EXPOSED COPPER\n   D. VENDOR DATE CODE, LOGO, UL AND ANY ADDITIONAL MARKING TO BE LOCATED ON THE SECONDARY SIDE\n6. HOLES & VIAS:\n   A. ALL HOLES PTH UNLESS SPECIFIED\n   B. MINIMUM PTH COPPER THICKNESS TO BE IN ACCORDANCE WITH IPC-6012, CLASS2\n   C. HOLE DIAMETERS GIVEN ARE AFTER PLATING ±0.003{dblquote} (±0.075 mm)\n   D. ALL VIAS ARE TENTED ON BOTH SIDES UNLESS SOLDERMASK OPENED IN GERBER.\n   E. VIAS UNDER EXPOSED PADS SHALL BE UNTENTED OR FILLED AS PER DESIGN\n7. BOARD OUTLINE:\n   A. PROFILE TOLERANCE: ±0.2 mm\n   B. EDGES SHALL BE SMOOTH AND BURR-FREE\n8. ELECTRICAL TEST:\n   A. 100% NETLIST TEST (CONTINUITY) REQUIRED\n9. CLEANLINESS:\n   A. PCB SHALL BE FREE FROM CONTAMINATION, DELAMINATION, AND DEFECTS\n10. OTHER:\n    A. PARAMETERS NOT SPECIFIED SHALL FOLLOW IPC-6012 CLASS2"
		(at 181.58 112.58 0)
		(layer "User.2")
		(uuid "71378032-1a71-424b-a5aa-c87c74eb1b40")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
				(thickness 0.15)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "ASSEMBLY NOTES:\n\n1. COMPONENT POPULATION:\n   A. REFER TO BOM FOR NON-POPULATED PARTS NOTED AS {dblquote}DNP{dblquote}\n2. ASSEMBLY REQUIREMENTS:\n   A. ENSURE CORRECT ORIENTATION AND POLARITY OF ALL COMPONENTS\n4. CONFORMAL COATING:\n   A. ALL PCBAs SHALL BE CONFORMAL COATED WITH POLYURETHANE-BASED COATING\n   B. COATING MATERIAL SHALL COMPLY WITH UL746E AND IPC-CC-830\n   C. ENSURE UNIFORM COATING WITHOUT BUBBLES, VOIDS, OR EXCESS BUILD-UP\n5. CLEANING:\n   A. PCBAs SHALL BE CLEAN AND FREE FROM FLUX RESIDUE PRIOR TO COATING\n6. INSPECTION:\n   A. VISUAL INSPECTION SHALL BE PERFORMED\n\n7. TESTING:\n   A. ELECTRICAL TESTING, PHYSICAL TESTING TO BE SPECIFIED AT TIME OF MANUFACTURING PER PCBA\n8. PACKAGING:\n   A. PCBAs SHALL BE PACKAGED IN ESD-SAFE BAGS\n   B. INCLUDE DESICCANT AND HUMIDITY INDICATOR CARD\n   C. OUTER PACKAGING SHALL PREVENT DAMAGE DURING SHIPPING AND HANDLING\n"
		(at 181.58 150.2 0)
		(layer "User.2")
		(uuid "7fa4a4f1-69d7-4a7e-8055-f3fb48483b6d")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
				(thickness 0.15)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "LAYER STACK:\n   A. PCB SHALL BE MANUFACTURED AS A 2-LAYER BOARD\n   B. LAYER CONFIGURATION:\n      - L1: TOP SIGNAL / POWER / GND\n      - L2: BOTTOM SIGNAL / POWER / GND"
		(at 181.58 162.025 0)
		(layer "User.2")
		(uuid "1f12bb9a-3fa1-4f08-bb6f-df17a0caf842")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
				(thickness 0.15)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
	)
